@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:のあが魔法で<br>できること、<br>お絵描きすること<br>ぐらいだもん。|#0203Trial11_Noah002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"<link=\"Objection_02_03_11_01\">お絵描きでもない</link>のに<br>魔法を使うなんて……<br>そんなことできるわけないよ。|#0203Trial11_Noah003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1,ArmR3,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:た、たしかにノアさんが<br>絵を描く以外で<br>魔法を使っているのは<br>見たこと<br>ありませんわ……！|#0203Trial11_Hanna001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR4,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:それにのあ、<br>あのときずっと<br>図書室にいたしね。|#0203Trial11_Noah004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR4,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:中庭になんて<br>行ってないよ？|#0203Trial11_Noah005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR4,ArmL5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……でもノアちゃん、<br>さっき雨が降ったのを<br>【見た】って言ってたよね。|#0203Trial11_Ema001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Nervous_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ボクも雨が<br>降っているのは見たけど、<br>雨が降ってるのを見たのは<br>中庭だ。|#0203Trial11_Ema002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Nervous_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:外にいたアリサちゃんは<br>雨なんて降ってなかったって<br>言ってる。|#0203Trial11_Ema003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Determined_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:図書室にいたなら、<br>雨が降ったのを<br>どこから見たのかな。|#0203Trial11_Ema004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR4,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"そういえば、<br>あのときは<br>【見た】んじゃなくて<br><link=\"Objection_02_03_11_02\">【聞いた】</link>だけ<br>だったかな？|#0203Trial11_Noah006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR4,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
